tender.description:
GA Trains Limited ("GATL") has a requirement for Software as a Service ("SaaS") licences to support the continued supply of its Enterprise Asset Management ("EAM") platform, including:
• 220 Full licences, 83 Lite licences;
• 32 Mobile licences;
• 4 Connector licences;
• 1 Web Services licence;
• 2 Report Author licences; and
• Databridge Pro
The required outcome is to ensure the uninterrupted supply of licences to ensure continuity for the use of GATLs existing EAM solution.

